  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 38,
    "summary": "David sorrows for his sins—They rest as a disease upon him—He asks the Lord to be compassionate.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "O Lord, rebuke me not in thy wrath: neither chasten me in thy hot displeasure.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:1",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "For thine arrows stick fast in me, and thy hand presseth me sore.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:2",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "There is no soundness in my flesh because of thine anger; neither is there any rest in my bones because of my sin.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 8
          },
          {
            "start": 66,
            "end": 78
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:3",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "For mine iniquities are gone over mine head: as an heavy burden they are too heavy for me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:4",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "My wounds stink and are corrupt because of my foolishness.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 19
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:5",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "I am troubled; I am bowed down greatly; I go mourning all the day long.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:6",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "For my loins are filled with a loathsome disease: and there is no soundness in my flesh.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 41,
            "end": 49
          },
          {
            "start": 54,
            "end": 62
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:7",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "I am feeble and sore broken: I have roared by reason of the disquietness of my heart.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 31,
            "end": 42,
            "text": "OR groaned."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:8",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Lord, all my desire is before thee; and my groaning is not hid from thee.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 22
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:9",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "My heart panteth, my strength faileth me: as for the light of mine eyes, it also is gone from me.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 67,
            "end": 71,
            "text": "Ps. 88:9."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Ps. 88:9.",
            "prettyString": "Psalms 88:9",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "psalms",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 88,
                    "end": 88,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 9,
                        "end": 9
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:10",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "My lovers and my friends stand aloof from my sore; and my kinsmen stand afar off.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 3,
            "end": 24,
            "text": "HEB friends and neighbors."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:11",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "They also that seek after my life lay snares for me: and they that seek my hurt speak mischievous things, and imagine deceits all the day long.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 118,
            "end": 125,
            "text": "TG Deceit."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 45,
            "end": 52
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Deceit.",
            "prettyString": "TG Deceit",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Deceit",
                "entryId": "tg-deceit",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:12",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "But I, as a deaf man, heard not; and I was as a dumb man that openeth not his mouth.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 17,
            "end": 21
          },
          {
            "start": 37,
            "end": 42
          },
          {
            "start": 57,
            "end": 61
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:13",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "Thus I was as a man that heareth not, and in whose mouth are no reproofs.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 57,
            "end": 60
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:14",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "For in thee, O Lord, do I hope: thou wilt hear, O Lord my God.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:15",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "For I said, Hear me, lest otherwise they should rejoice over me: when my foot slippeth, they magnify themselves against me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 20
          },
          {
            "start": 26,
            "end": 35
          },
          {
            "start": 101,
            "end": 111
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:16",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "For I am ready to halt, and my sorrow is continually before me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 6,
            "end": 8
          },
          {
            "start": 38,
            "end": 40
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:17",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "For I will declare mine iniquity; I will be sorry for my sin.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 11,
            "end": 18,
            "text": "TG Confession."
          },
          {
            "start": 44,
            "end": 49,
            "text": "TG Repent."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Confession.",
            "prettyString": "TG Confession",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Confession",
                "entryId": "tg-confession",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "raw": "TG Repent.",
            "prettyString": "TG Repent",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Repent",
                "entryId": "tg-repent",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:18",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "But mine enemies are lively, and they are strong: and they that hate me wrongfully are multiplied.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 17,
            "end": 20
          },
          {
            "start": 29,
            "end": 32
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:19",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "They also that render evil for good are mine adversaries; because I follow the thing that good is.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "Ps. 35:12."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 75,
            "end": 89
          },
          {
            "start": 95,
            "end": 98
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Ps. 35:12.",
            "prettyString": "Psalms 35:12",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "psalms",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 35,
                    "end": 35,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 12,
                        "end": 12
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:20",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "Forsake me not, O Lord: O my God, be not far from me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:21",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 38,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "Make haste to help me, O Lord my salvation.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 38:22",
